<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Electronic Data cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Electronic Data cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney cut its rating for Electronic Data Systems Corp Friday to neutral from buy, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Plano, Texas, company fell to 34-1/2 in pre-opening trade from their Thursday close of 42.  The company reported late Thursday that first quarter profits dropped 11 percent from the same period a year before.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
